{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;5 Min Space Battle&gt; is a fast-paced third-person 3D space combat shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the controls of your space fighter to destroy enemies \u2192 gain experience \u2192 strengthen yourself, and face the upcoming BOSS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Multiple Space Fighters:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a variety of uniquely styled space fighters to pilot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different fighters are equipped with distinct weapon types, including but not limited to projectile weapons, laser weapons, drones, shields, and repair systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Multiple Difficulties:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty 1 is relatively gentle: after 5 minutes of combat, a random boss will appear, with slightly fewer rewards. It is ideal for familiarizing yourself with space fighters and stably earning in-game currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty 2 is the game\u2019s standard difficulty: two bosses will appear, requiring you to adapt to their combinations while leveraging your space fighter\u2019s unique features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Randomness:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss appearances and upgrade card draws are random, adding unpredictability to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minor enemies also spawn randomly, so you\u2019ll need to eliminate as many targets as quickly as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses will absorb some minor enemies on the field to strengthen themselves\u2014the more they absorb, the stronger they become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the game, all space fighter pilots!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3759210?t=1755220071","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759210/bac43c882a1ce89d990d32007b005c69ae9f407c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755220071","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759210/dbb0ffe9918e63216a891197ec1ebc7c9dbc362b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755220071","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759210/dbb0ffe9918e63216a891197ec1ebc7c9dbc362b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755220071","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>CONTACT US</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u5982\u679c\u53d1\u73b0BUG\uff0c\u6216\u8005\u6709\u60ca\u5929\u52a8\u5730\u7684\u60f3\u6cd5\u8981\u5206\u4eab\uff0c\u968f\u65f6\u8054\u7cfb\u6211\u5c31\u884c\u3002</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find any bug or you have some ideas to tell, feel free to contact me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30d0\u30b0\u3092\u898b\u3064\u3051\u305f\u308a\u3001\u4f55\u304b\u30a2\u30a4\u30c7\u30a2\u304c\u3042\u3063\u305f\u3089\u3001\u6c17\u8efd\u306b\u9023\u7d61\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ\u7fa4\uff1a1003196091</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><a href=\"mailto:Email\uff1a563796786@qq.com\">Email\uff1a563796786@qq.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&lt;5 Min Space Battle&gt; is a fast-paced third-person 3D space combat shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the controls of your space fighter to destroy enemies \u2192 gain experience \u2192 strengthen yourself, and face the upcoming BOSS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Multiple Space Fighters:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a variety of uniquely styled space fighters to pilot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different fighters are equipped with distinct weapon types, including but not limited to projectile weapons, laser weapons, drones, shields, and repair systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Multiple Difficulties:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty 1 is relatively gentle: after 5 minutes of combat, a random boss will appear, with slightly fewer rewards. It is ideal for familiarizing yourself with space fighters and stably earning in-game currency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty 2 is the game\u2019s standard difficulty: two bosses will appear, requiring you to adapt to their combinations while leveraging your space fighter\u2019s unique features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Randomness:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss appearances and upgrade card draws are random, adding unpredictability to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minor enemies also spawn randomly, so you\u2019ll need to eliminate as many targets as quickly as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses will absorb some minor enemies on the field to strengthen themselves\u2014the more they absorb, the stronger they become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the game, all space fighter pilots!</p>","developers":["Beijing 0503 Technology Co., Ltd"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759210/fe9dffb3eff9231d2f4c6a5478f81b88bdb76143/header.jpg?t=1755220071","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3759210/354888593/0a52265001e396c47796119c10c7fe617085098b/1755180421/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755182369","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3759210/354888593/0a52265001e396c47796119c10c7fe617085098b/1755180421/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755182369","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3759210/354888593/0a52265001e396c47796119c10c7fe617085098b/1755180421/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755182369","id":257183198,"name":"In Game Footage Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257183198/33acce12aa10658b5bd64a387b82e831f4c986f4/movie_600x33